    "body": "**Re: University Monday 2022/03/21** / 2022/03/23\r\n\r\n1.2.1.3 Groups to be FERPA compliant. \r\n\r\n1.2.1.3.1 In settings/privacy center at the bottom above Privacy Statement add a Checkbox default to false for \"FERPA compliant\". Store in Core BB user profile?\r\n\r\n1.2.1.3.2 May need Mladen. In Groups only show a user's Name to Admins if this user has FERPA True. So for regular members anywhere they can see a member's name it must be hidden. For now just show \"Suppressed\" as the name.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Update**: FIRMA replaced with FERPA",
